{
  "id": 8867094626503,
  "title": "Horse Patchwork Pattern Quilt Set, Vintage Animal Quilt Printed",
  "handle": "horse-patchwork-pattern-quilt-set-vintage-animal-quilt-printed",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the charm of the countryside with our Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set, featuring classic patterns for a cozy, timeless look. Perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom, this quilt set offers customization options to make it uniquely yours or a thoughtful gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Rustic elegance with a farmhouse patchwork style pattern, perfect for a cozy, timeless look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by selecting a size, adding pillowcases, or including a custom name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> This farmhouse quilt is available in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat, ensuring quick drying and maintaining its fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> The set includes one quilt, with an option to add two pillowcases.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
